{
  "$defs": {
    "ContactAvailability": {
      "description": "平台侧这个联系还在不在。\n\n## 为什么要有\"原因\"而不是一个 ``unavailable: bool``\n\n三种不在的情况对用户的含义不同，界面上是一行灰字，但**排障时**要能区分：\n\n- ``left``：机器人自己**主动退出**了群（``group_decrease`` + ``leave``）；\n- ``kicked``：机器人被**踢出**群（``kick_me``）；群可能还在，只是我们进不去；\n- ``friend_deleted``：对方**删了好友**（``get_friend_list`` 里查不到）。\n\n``kicked`` 和 ``left`` 在界面上的处置一样（都读不到新消息了），但把\"被踢\"\n记成\"自己退的\"是错误归属——与撤回路径里 ``self_recall`` 单列的理由相同。\n\n## 为什么是字符串常量而不是布尔\n\n布尔值只能回答\"在不在\"，答不出\"为什么\"。而\"为什么\"是这条信息唯一能\n帮上忙的地方：用户看到灰掉的一行，第一个问题永远是\"我怎么不在了\"。",
      "enum": [
        "left",
        "kicked",
        "friend_deleted"
      ],
      "title": "ContactAvailability",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "$id": "https://ling.local/contracts/v1/SessionRecord.schema.json",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "会话窗口的权威记录（不是浏览器缓存）。",
  "properties": {
    "actor_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Actor Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "archived": {
      "default": false,
      "title": "Archived",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "channel": {
      "default": "web",
      "title": "Channel",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "contact_unavailable": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ContactAvailability"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null
    },
    "created_at": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Created At",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "display_name": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Display Name"
    },
    "familiarity": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "number"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Familiarity"
    },
    "group_reply_max_parts": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Group Reply Max Parts"
    },
    "message_count": {
      "default": 0,
      "minimum": 0,
      "title": "Message Count",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "peer_id": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Peer Id"
    },
    "pinned": {
      "default": false,
      "title": "Pinned",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "schema_version": {
      "const": "v1",
      "default": "v1",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "session_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Session Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "subject_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Subject Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "title": {
      "title": "Title",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "updated_at": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Updated At",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "window_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Window Id",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "session_id",
    "actor_id",
    "subject_id",
    "window_id",
    "title",
    "created_at",
    "updated_at"
  ],
  "title": "SessionRecord",
  "type": "object",
  "x-ling-schema-version": "v1"
}
